body:
Should we, can we handle this? As seen in http://shipow.github.io/searchbox/

@Shipow's searchbox is not yet using instantsearch but if we would want to use it we would not be able to do it competely. It's using a button reset for the reset of the input (native dom behavior).

Either we can solve it easily, natively without any other API entry OR we start providing searchBox instance methods like searchBoxWidgetInstance.setQuery() that will update and run a new search.
